---
<section class="section section-bg-gray">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <h2 class="text-xs" style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center;"><span class="text-primary">02</span> SUPPLY PARTNERSHIP</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-3 gap-4 mobile-slider">
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-1" style="padding: 1.25rem; height: 100%;">
        <span class="text-xs text-muted">FOR PROCUREMENT & REPEAT BUYERS</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg text-primary" style="margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">STANDARD PRODUCTS</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;">Access a broad range of hydraulic fitting families covering DIN, JIC, ORFS, conversion and other connection requirements. Find the product range and identify the relevant fitting family for your requirement.</p>
        <div class="img-box" style="aspect-ratio: 21/9; max-height: 140px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0; overflow: hidden; background: white;">
          <img src="https://www.hy-techengineers.com/images/product3.jpg" alt="Standard Products" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
        </div>
        <a href="#products" class="btn btn-primary" style="align-self: flex-start; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; margin-top: auto;">
          EXPLORE RANGE ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-1" style="padding: 1.25rem; height: 100%;">
        <span class="text-xs text-muted">FOR OEM & ENGINEERING TEAMS</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg text-primary" style="margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">CUSTOM / OEM</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;">Work with HIDROPEX from product development through prototype machining and production. Our engineering team supports optimized fitting design and dedicated manufacturing solutions.</p>
        <div class="img-box" style="aspect-ratio: 21/9; max-height: 140px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
          <img src="https://www.hidropex.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ASITENCIA-TECNICA-2-611x400.png" alt="OEM Requirements" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;">
        </div>
        <a href="#conversion" class="btn btn-outline" style="align-self: flex-start; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; margin-top: auto;">
          SEND REQUEST ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-1" style="padding: 1.25rem; height: 100%;">
        <span class="text-xs text-muted">FOR CRITICAL APPLICATIONS</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg text-primary" style="margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">QUALITY & COMPLIANCE</h3>
        <p class="text-sm" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.4;">Manufactured in IATF 16949 certified facilities with rigorous testing. We ensure zero-defect delivery and complete traceability for all high-pressure hydraulic applications globally.</p>
        <div class="img-box" style="aspect-ratio: 21/9; max-height: 140px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
          <img src="https://www.hidropex.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DSC02733-640x400.jpg" alt="Quality Facility" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;">
        </div>
        <a href="#company" class="btn btn-outline" style="align-self: flex-start; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; margin-top: auto;">
          VIEW STANDARDS ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
